elp\n\nhttps://github.com/P3nguinMinecraft/WizardSimulatorGUI\nUses Rayfield GUI Library (https://docs.sirius.menu/rayfield)\n\n\nFast Manage Pets\nBy specifying a pet slot you can equip, unequip, or delete the pet\n\n\nChest QOL\nPurchase pet chests from anywhere in the world, skipping the animation\nAbility to reroll pets from a chest (by deleting them)\n\n\nQuest Manipulation\nGive/cancel any quest in the game\nToggle to automatically give you the Training 2 quest for easy farming\n\n\nPotions\nPick up potions (mana and health) from anywhere in the world as long as it is loaded and exists\nToggle to automatically pick up potions at any threshold\n\n\nAutofarm\nAutofarm any enemy in the game from a stationary location\nConfigurable delay, range\nOption to give the Training 2 quest for AFK farming\nOption to Recharge at 30% Mana (requires Gamepass I think)\n\n\nTracker\nTracks Gold and XP gains, resettable and togglable\n\n\nTools\nWalkspeed and Jump Power sliders/toggles\nLinks to many universal scripts\n\n\nOptions\nTheme changer for Rayfield GUIs\n\n\nKeybinds for most features","tags":["autofarm","gui","wizard simulator","open source"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"665632fc672e7c3b1a87f7eb","username":"penguin586970","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"665632fc672e7c3b1a87f7eb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T23:24:42.374Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e5b360710ec3c50fb5","editBy":{"_id":"665632fc672e7c3b1a87f7eb","username":"penguin586970","status":"offline","id":"665632fc672e7c3b1a87f7eb"},"message":